.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt INSTALL_MAN.SH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm install_man.sh
.Nd install or remove man pages for Spacecentricity’s helper scripts (QMK firmware build tools)
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl i | Fl -install
.Op Fl r | Fl -remove | Fl -remove-all
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is an optional POSIX-compliant script for installing or removing this project’s man pages.
.Pp
It copies the pages in
.Pa docs/man
into your local man page directory, making them accessible via
.Ic man ,
e.g.,
.Ic man build.sh .
.Pp
With no options,
.Nm
defaults to installing the man pages.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl i , Fl -install
Install man pages. This is the default behavior when no options are given.
.It Fl r , Fl -remove
Remove previously installed man pages.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show the help message and exit.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Install man pages:
.Pp
.Dl install_man.sh
.Pp
Install man pages explicitly:
.Pp
.Dl install_man.sh --install
.Pp
Remove installed man pages:
.Pp
.Dl install_man.sh --remove
.Sh TIPS
Before running this script, check for man page namespace conflicts:
.Pp
.Dl man -w Ao Ar script-name Ac Ns .sh
.Pp
After installing man pages, view them with:
.Pp
.Dl man build.sh
.Dl man install.sh
.Dl man uninstall.sh
.Dl man license_headers.sh
.Dl man install_man.sh
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr build.sh 1 ,
.Xr install.sh 1 ,
.Xr uninstall.sh 1 ,
.Xr license_headers.sh 1 ,
.Xr spacecentricity 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An LittleWalter
.Sh SOURCE CODE
.Lk https://github.com/LittleWalter/spacecentricity-mk47
